# 强制 OpenWrt 插件核心脚本与配置保持 Unix LF 换行符
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.lua text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
ipselect text eol=lf
ipselect-runner text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
# 含内嵌 gzip 二进制 payload 的自安装脚本必须按二进制处理，禁止 git 换行符转换
luci-app-ipselect-openwrt25-installer.sh binary
# 编译产物 / 压缩归档保持二进制原样
*.ipk binary
*.tar.gz binary
